      "mentions": 19,
      "title": {
        "en": "Engaging social environment for pets"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet parents highlight that dogs enjoy active group play with companions of similar size and temperament. Reviews note that pets return home happily tired after full days of socializing. Clients with elderly rescues or special dietary routines also report that their animals receive attentive monitoring throughout each stay."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "staff",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 19,
      "title": {
        "en": "Attentive and familiar boarding team"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers warmly describe the caregivers and front desk team as kind, reliable, and attentive to individual pet needs. Pet owners appreciate seeing familiar faces who remember their dogs and cats by name upon arrival. Clients consistently emphasize the peace of mind they feel when entrusting their companions to the facility."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "place",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 11,
      "title": {
        "en": "Cage-free lodging and webcam monitoring"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients frequently praise the cage-free layout and spacious suites designed for both dogs and cats. Pet parents value the live webcam access that allows them to check on their animals remotely during vacations or workdays. The boarding areas and play spaces are consistently described as clean, roomy, and secure."
      }
    }
  ],
